  "description": "Odd wheels for balanced handling. With a strong and manoeuvrable 20-inch front wheel providing strength and a rear 27.5-inch hoop taking care of rider comfort, the Munroe Cargo will look after both you and your stuff. Employing a dedicated cargo rack with a sizable carry limit, it’ll take a month’s shopping home, or deliver an amp to your friend’s gig. Day off playing courier? Then ditch the rack for nippier city use.\n\nWeights & Limits\n\nWeight frame: 3240 g frame (size M, incl. TA, hanger, rack and bolts)",
